1. English:
The "TechnoMedNeuro" software suite is an educational, scientific, and research
prototype developed for contactless neurological biomarker quantification,
clinical decision support (CDSS) modeling, and assistive communication (AAC).
It is NOT a certified medical device and is NOT intended to replace professional
medical advice, clinical diagnosis, or treatment by a qualified healthcare
provider. All calculated metrics, spectral parameters, and graph-based syndrome
hypotheses are provided strictly for informational and research purposes.

